{"body":{"text":["A paragraph holds its text, as runs: the text as written, its marks within it, *emphasis*, **strong**, `code` and links to the web, and a holon wherever something points at a part of it alone, lifted out and held in its place: a sentence a thread was raised in or a measure reaches, or a link into the field; a term, settled as a holon made on purpose (8/33), would be one too, though none is made yet. Nothing is lifted before something points there: \"a holon could be a paragrpah until something wants to point at only a sentance\" (19/45). A diff compares text, and a selection is a place in it: \"the component that does the diff simplu just has to compares trings, for selection we still allow char selections\", \"so i dont see the point of this high fidelity thing, rather we break down where needed for references\" (19/41). Holding so grows finer only where something reaches in, a grain like the one the author raised at 18/55, as the session drew it (19/46). *Settled, 19/45, \"I think it makes sense\" (19/47), on the session's restatement (19/46); built.*"]},"id":"1M82PYKFR78E000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Words were holons once, and never at the author's asking. At 2/6 he had said \"So definitely, down to paragraphs, and using sentences relationship and words relationship\", and left the holons to the session's creativity; the second session read it as holons down to the word, its own path, and a later session kept them for fidelity (8/32), though he had answered only \"yes terms is a thing\" (8/33), leaving the words unremarked. \"why at each word, i have never asked for that, it doesnt make sense\" (19/37); \"only if it is a term etc\" (19/38). A sentence something points at must be one: \"when a thread points to a sentance it needs to be a sentance, thats they way it is\" (19/43). Sentences as holons he allowed \"for now i guess\" (19/43), \"for now it may be fine\" (19/45), before his own finer word. The stores were folded once, through the engine: some 230,000 words and the holons of marks let go, and every sentence a thread or a measure points at lifted, 95 in all, so the field went from about 252,000 holons to some 7,000, and Knowledge reads as text exactly as it did (19/49)."]},"id":"1M82PYKFR78E001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Reading Knowledge as text takes about a quarter of a second at the command line over the five stores, where it took 0.8 s while every word was a holon (19/49). On the site a brief opens in 60 to 210 ms once the field is fetched, after the brief's read was found entering every brief beneath it, its stop lost behind a placeholder the engine matches by type (19/39). The engine still lets go of what a use gives beyond what its function takes, without a word, which is to be refused, since nothing is to fail silently (19/39). Still between: `language/text.ts` keeps the earlier form of expressions for its own tests alone."]},"id":"1M82PYKFR78E002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Then, committed through the engine, every expression was written again as uses, once for good; glass's types were grouped, a second function type and the paper's own prose types let go for glass's, and the markdown forms and the types nothing used let go. Git keeps only each store's history, about 48 MB, and each index is rebuilt from it. Since prose was folded to its text, the five hold about 7,000 holons where they held 252,000 (19/49). *Proposed, 18/104; built.*"]},"id":"1M82PYKFR78E003","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}